                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-chapter-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1873-12-01T23:59:59-04:56"
                            notBefore="1873-01-01T00:00:00-04:56">undated</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>[<hi rendition="#italic">N. B.—The summary of this correspondence is omitted. It
                        mainly relates to the doctrine of perpetual allegiance, which was abandoned
                        by Congress in the act of</hi> 1868, (15 <hi rendition="#italic">Statutes at
                        Large</hi>, 223,) <hi rendition="#italic">and which has also been abandoned
                        by Great Britain and other powers with whom we have treaties of
                        naturalization</hi>.]</p>
            </div>
